  "independent_review": "The generated data region and all nongenerated source match the original. Replacing 22 private row proofs with one finite case split followed by definitional simplification and ring preserves the public theorem and needs no additional heartbeat. The generator produces exactly the checked-in region. All eight refreshed prerequisite records and all four fresh baseline/final records have zero status. Target, client, focus, and 17-public-axiom reports match after removing only the terminal timing line; no proof or API defect was found."
